# CQ 06: Which prediction fulfils which task?
#
# What closes the circle from the output back to the objective the system was
# built for. 3.1.27 defines the prediction as the primary output of an AI
# system when provided with input data.
#
# In test case 3 only the second prediction fulfils the task. The first is
# carried forward as input to the symbolic component, which is what note 1 to
# 3.1.27 describes: predictions can be followed by further outputs.
PREFIX iso:  <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#>
PREFIX inst: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989/instances#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
SELECT ?prediction ?task ?taskKind
WHERE {
  ?prediction iso:fulfilsTask ?task .
  ?task a ?taskKind .
  ?taskKind rdfs:subClassOf iso:Task .
} ORDER BY ?prediction
